Cell[TextData[StyleBox["1. In the test, p is the number of orbits; k is the \
number of pairs; \n2. single-particle energies are set as epsilon[i]=i;\n3. \
pairing strength is set to as the orbit independent pairing G[i,j]=-0.5;\n4. \
The quasi-spin of the i-th orbit S[i]=(j+1/2)/2, where j is the angular \
momentum quantum number of the i-th orbit.",
 FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 0.]]], "Section",
